<title>JAPAN: Hac Kimisawa to list on TSE second section Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Hac Kimisawa to list on TSE second section Nov 21.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hac Kimisawa Co Ltd will list its shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange's second section on November 21, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Hac Kimisawa, a medium-ranking supermarket chain operator based in Shizuoka, central Japan, is currently listed on the second section of the Nagoya stock exchange.</p>
<p>The company will sell 800,000 shares through a secondary offering, the TSE said.</p>
